                <head>VE–9. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>Vice President Richard M. Nixon visited Venezuela May 13–15, 1958, as part of a
                    tour of several South American countries which he made between April 27 and May
                    15, 1958. Nixon’s visit was marred by severe violence which forced cancellation
                    of all public events.</p>
            </div>
